      "section": "Rearrangement map",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "The 24 GRCh38 chromosomes on a ring, one chord per rearrangement joining its two breakpoints; width is the read support on a log scale, colour the event class, so only translocations cross the ring while deletions and duplications hug the rim. Hover a chord for its loci, click it to filter the dashboard by that event, click the background to clear; colour-by and the intra-chromosomal toggle are in the header. Input: Manta, TIDDIT or SvABA calls from nf-core/sarek, or arriba and STAR-Fusion from rnafusion.\n",
